00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:32.040
so it uses some of those design
patterns that we'll discuss?

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.540
So those are really the three
main goals of this session.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:35.998
JAMES DUKE: Yeah,
in the first two,

00:01:35.998 --> 00:01:38.553
we'll level the
set a little bit.

00:01:38.553 --> 00:01:40.220
We'll talk about the
